WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.640
I think it was deceptively easy.

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:05.300
And what I mean by deceptively easy is it

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:09.400
didn't feel like we were doing enough on site

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.700
to capture the data that we desired.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:15.140
It felt almost like we weren't putting enough

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:19.120
effort in using Quickler because it was deceptively easy

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:22.600
to capture the data by purely just describing it

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.450
or just taking a short series of photographs.

